# Testing Rules

Every feature should be tested at the lowest useful level and then at integration level.

Required where applicable:
- unit tests
- component tests
- API/integration tests
- negative/error-path tests
- authorization/ownership tests
- state transition tests
- idempotency/retry tests
- migration tests
- regression tests

A task is not DONE because code compiles.
A task is DONE only when its acceptance criteria are satisfied and relevant tests pass.

QA must report exact reproduction steps for failures.
